  "data_abstract": "Measurement of J/PSI production in d+Au and p+p collisions at center-of-mass energy of 200GeV. The cross-sections and nuclear dependence of J/PSI production versus rapidity,transverse momentum and centrality are presented     In this paper, the value XF is the momentum fraction of the gluon in the deuteron, minus it's momentum fraction in Au.\n",
